    <string name="login_help_password_text">Zama ukufaka noma yimaphi amanye amakheli e-imeyili (noma amagama abasebenzisi) okungenzeka uwasebenzisile ukubhalisa.\n\nI-akhawunti yakho kungenzeka ixhunywe ku-Facebook. Uma kunjalo, faka igama lakho lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi ye-Facebook bese uyazama futhi.\n\nAkulungi namanje? Setha iphasiwedi yakho kabusha - spotify.com/password-reset</string>
    <string name="login_help_password_title">Unenkinga yokungena?</string>
    <string name="login_help_pin_text">Hlola ukuxhumeka kwenethiwekhi yefoni yakho nemoto bese uzama futhi.\n\nQiniseka uyifake kahle i-URL: spotify.com/pair kudivayisi yakho yeselula.\n\nVala uhlelo lwe-Spotify emotweni yakho bese uyazama futhi. Faka kabusha ikhodi efonini bese uyazama futhi.</string>
    <string name="login_help_pin_title">Unenkinga ngokungena ngemvume nge-PIN?</string>
    <string name="login_help_scannable_text">Uma ikhodi ye-QR ingaskeneki kahle, kunalokho zama ukungena ngemvume ngekhodi ye-PIN.\n\nUma ifoni yakho ingenaso iskena sekhodi ye-QR esakhelwe ngaphakathi, ungasithola esitolo sohlelo.</string>
